Derek had looked at her.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Where were you?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Working."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"With the door closed?"\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Yes."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Derek nodded.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
"Well, that settles it."\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Penny Gent had smiled.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Trevor had looked at the two of them.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then at the closed door.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then at Derek.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
Then at Penny Gent.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
He had wisely said nothing.\par\pard\plain\hyphpar} {	
